","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4955051?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit","html_url":"https://github.com/Arnklit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-24T15:30:07Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T12:14:02Z","body":"One thing worth noting. I found this [issue](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122763) - when tracks get hidden due the `Only show tracks from nodes selected in tree.` filter option, the selected track will render black. This was easily resolved by checking if the track was filtered in the if statement around rendering the selected track, but you will have the same issue in this PR when the selected track disappears due to filtering.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/86d5ea2b-e0c1-480f-88ea-7d3ceb475f6c\r\n\r\nYou could take this into account by moving your filtering code into the `AnimationBezierTrackEdit::set_filtered(bool p_filtered)` function and using the same bool as the `Only show tracks from nodes selected in tree.` option uses. Then when the [PR](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122767) I opened for resolving that issue gets merged, it would fix the issue for both types of filtering.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5397495767/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]